// has been refused (R1a — mirrors trace.js's refusal-informed final
// hop: the next traceHop() restarts a fresh trace through the
// existing `hop >= finalHop` path, no phantom chain past the
// refusal), 2 once the answer says NX, 6 for a CDN GET served from
